OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUS and Iran trade retaliatory attacks
OL,4,Aon ships as conflict flares
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran's state media confirmed the
OL,7,Fstrikes and said Tehran had attacked
OL,8,Fthree US-affiliated vessels in
OL,9,Fresponse, as well as three oil tankers
OL,10,Ftravelling through the Strait of Hormuz
OL,11,Falong an "unauthorised" route.
OL,13,FThe BBC has approached US Central
OL,14,FCommand (Centcom) for comment about
OL,15,FIran's latest claims to have targeted
OL,16,FUS ships.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
